      "label": "CALCULATION",
      "text": "With the other assumptions at base, the valuation is most sensitive to the cost of capital (one percentage point either way: a model value of ₹2,753 to ₹3,985 a share) and to how long TCS keeps earning high returns on new investment (anywhere from returns equal to its cost of capital to a quarter above its past level: a model value of ₹2,355 to ₹3,280 a share); the Q3 FY27 result will be the next test of the mechanical forecast.",
